<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρία</span> (signfs. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπλώματ᾽ οὐ θεωρικά</span> no
				<i>festal</i> robes, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				97
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. σκηνή</span> the tent <i>used
				by the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωροί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Henioch.
				5.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. ὁδός</span>,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.55
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρικόν, τό </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρικός, ὁ</span>,
			seems to be an error in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.208
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>), at Athens, <i>fund for providing free seats at public
				spectacles</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐπὶ τὸ
			θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				43.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				47.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.223<i>C</i>5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀρχὴ ἡ ἐπὶ τῷ θ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.24
			</span></i>: pl. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				9
			</span></i>: so elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρικά</span>, with
			or without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>, <i>fund for
				festivals,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1333
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				473.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
